<section
  class="wwb-section wwb-method"
  id="our-way-of-building"
  aria-labelledby="wwb-method-title"
>
  <div class="wwb-shell">
    <p class="wwb-eyebrow"><span>03</span> OUR WAY OF BUILDING</p>
    <div class="wwb-section-intro wwb-intro-split">
      <h2 id="wwb-method-title">Understand first.<br /><em>Build second.</em></h2>
      <p class="wwb-lead">
        We go deep into a problem—its people, incentives, systems, constraints, evidence, and
        desired outcomes—before deciding what needs to exist.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="wwb-method-track">
      <div class="wwb-method-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
      {[
        [
          '01',
          'UNDERSTAND',
          'We immerse ourselves in the problem to understand its real context.',
        ],
        [
          '02',
          'DESIGN',
          'We translate insights into a solution approach designed around the problem, not the tech.',
        ],
        [
          '03',
          'BUILD',
          'We build with the right mix of capabilities—whatever the problem actually requires.',
        ],
        [
          '04',
          'SOLVE',
          'We deliver a working solution that people can use in the real world.',
        ],
        [
          '05',
          'MEASURE',
          'We measure what matters and learn what needs to improve next.',
        ],
      ].map((step, index) => (
        <article class={`wwb-method-step wwb-method-step-${index + 1}`}>
          <div class="wwb-method-node">
            <span>{step[0]}</span>
            <i></i>
          </div>
          <p class="wwb-method-index">STAGE {step[0]}</p>
          <h3>{step[1]}</h3>
          <p>{step[2]}</p>
          <div class="wwb-method-geometry" aria-hidden="true">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="wwb-method-principles">
      <p>
        We don’t start by asking, <em>“What can this technology do?”</em><br />
        We start by asking, <strong>“What would actually solve this?”</strong>
      </p>
      <div>
        <span>THIS IS NOT A LINEAR HANDOFF.</span>
        <small>Measurement feeds learning. Learning shapes the next iteration.</small>
        <span>WE DON’T DELIVER AND DISAPPEAR.</span>
        <small>We stay with the problem until it’s meaningfully solved.</small>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="wwb-next-link" href="#our-toolkit">NEXT: OUR TOOLKIT <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
